# Heat run of the closed Cu/Cu2O interface at 300 K (Table A1).
# equil.restart: the equilibrated cell, from the preparation. ffield.comb3: LAMMPS potentials folder.
# Groups along z, from the preparation: gbot (the fixed bottom layer), ghot and gcold (the baths at the two ends), gmob (every atom outside gbot).

units           metal
atom_style      charge
boundary        p p f
read_restart    equil.restart
mass            1 63.546
mass            2 15.999
pair_style      comb3 polar_off
pair_coeff      * * ffield.comb3 Cu O
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

fix             ffix gbot setforce 0 0 0
fix             fnve gmob nve
timestep        0.0002
fix             fhot  ghot  langevin 360 360 0.05 111 tally yes
fix             fcold gcold langevin 240 240 0.05 112 tally yes

variable        Aload equal lx*ly
variable        Ftot  equal 1.873e-3*v_Aload
variable        Npist equal count(gcold)
variable        fzp   equal -v_Ftot/v_Npist
fix             fload gcold addforce 0.0 0.0 ${fzp}

compute         cz gmob chunk/atom bin/1d z lower 2.0 units box
fix             ftz gmob ave/chunk 100 2500 250000 cz temp file tprofile.dat
run             9100000
